# Delivery App Backend

## Overview
This project is a backend system for a delivery application that manages users, orders, and delivery tracking. It provides RESTful APIs for handling authentication, order management, and delivery status updates.

## Features
- User registration and login
- JWT-based authentication
- Order creation and management
- Delivery status tracking
- Secure REST API endpoints

## Tech Stack
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB
- JWT Authentication
- REST APIs

## Project Structure

delivery-app-backend
│
├── controllers
├── routes
├── models
├── middleware
├── config
└── server.js

## Installation

1. Clone the repository

git clone https://github.com/yourusername/delivery-app-backend.git

2. Navigate to project folder

cd delivery-app-backend

3. Install dependencies

npm install

4. Run the server

npm start

## API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|------|------|------|
| POST | /api/auth/register | Register user |
| POST | /api/auth/login | Login user |
| POST | /api/orders | Create order |
| GET | /api/orders | Get all orders |
| PUT | /api/orders/:id | Update order status |

